# Post-release safety-metrics runbook — internal (Braintrust project ID + pre-fix
# abuse rates). The public blog/tweet is a sanitized derivative, not this file.
MONITORING_AFTER_RELEASE.md

# Moderation eval tooling — never commit. data/ holds real abuse prompts pulled
# from Braintrust; models/ holds downloaded weights. Only the deployable artifact
# lib/moderation/model.json (numeric weights, no prompt text) is committed.
scripts/moderation-eval/
# Reference prompts for the local parity test (clinical adult phrases). Not
# committed; the parity test skips gracefully when this file is absent.
lib/moderation/reference_scores.json
# Real abuse-prompt fixtures for the prompt-validation blocklist tests. Not
# committed; the abuse-prompt tests skip gracefully when this file is absent
# (mirrors reference_scores.json above).
lib/prompt-validation.fixtures.json
MONITORING_AFTER_RELEASE.md
